aker_1]: 啥不可能啊?\n音色(0-8秒): \n[speaker_1]的声音高亢、焦躁且充满压迫感；\n[speaker_2]的声音稚嫩、平静且带着一丝不以为意。\n音效(0-8秒): \n急促的指关节敲击木质桌面的“咚咚”声，铅笔在纸上划过的沙沙声，背景中客厅挂钟的滴答声。", 1344, 768, 73], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 241, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 242, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "first_frame", "link": 268, "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "first_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "last_frame"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 267, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 246, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 247, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "length"}, "name": "length", "link": 245, "label": "length", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "length"}], "flags": {}, "type": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [337.0048522949219, 563.3270263671875], "pos": [-59.76707077026367, 4947.89697265625], "id": 133, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.29.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"width": true, "length": true, "height": true}, "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo"}, "order": 19}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "浮点"}, {"name": "INT", "links": [245], "label": "INT", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "整数"}, {"name": "BOOL", "links": [], "label": "BOOL", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "BOOL"}], "size": [303.6666564941406, 128], "pos": [-408.31982421875, 5353.0947265625], "widgets_values": ["max(5, round(a * 24)) + (5 - (max(5, round(a * 24)) %