字的沙沙声、轻微的呼吸声和客厅环境白噪音。\n\n【分镜 1：0-8秒】\n中景双人镜头。妈妈俯身靠近儿子，右手指向作业本。\n0-8秒，妈妈面部紧绷，眉头紧锁，嘴唇快速开合，情绪激动地数落；儿子低头握笔，肩膀微微耸起。妈妈以愤怒且焦虑的语气说出：“一讲题，你就摆这副脸！写错作业还不让人说了？辅导你一回作业，我最少少活半年!”\n音频包含愤怒的女性声音、衣料摩擦声和铅笔在纸上无意识划动的微弱声。\n\n【分镜 2：8-13秒】\n反应近景镜头，对焦在儿子脸上。\n8-11秒，儿子停下手中的笔，微微抬头，斜眼看着妈妈，嘴唇微动。儿子以平静且笃定的语气说出：“不可能.”\n11-13秒，镜头切回妈妈，妈妈愣了一下，眼睛微微睁大。妈妈以疑惑且挑衅的语气说出：“啥不可能啊?”\n音频包含清脆的童声和妈妈疑惑的追问声。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [405.4881591796875, 342.1667785644531], "pos": [-1393.4197998046875, 4942.36865234375], "id": 146, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [248], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "浮点"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [15], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveFloat", "title": "Float (duration)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [308.6808166503906, 62.993370056152344], "pos": [-1355.1507568359375, 5567.05224609375], "id": 135, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.29.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveFloat"}, "order": 13}, {"showAdvanced": false, "outputs": [{"name": "width", "links": [246], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [247], "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["16:9 (Widescreen)", 0.6000000000000001, 32], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "megapixels"}, "name": "megapixels", "label": "megapixels", "type": "FLOAT", "localize